# Managed blue/green router state (RV-42).
#
# upgrade.sh writes Caddyfile, Caddyfile.next and Caddyfile.previous here at
# runtime and bind-mounts this directory into the edge container read-only.
# None of that is generated output for review: keep it out of Git.
#
# The directory itself must be tracked so a fresh clone already has it; if it
# were missing, Docker would create a root-owned empty directory on the first
# `docker compose up` and the edge container would mount an empty config.
*
!.gitignore
!.gitkeep
